rative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "جِدْنَ", "plain": "جِدْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/7fb22c3245c11b32b555.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "18:69", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2209.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Allah willing, thou shalt find me patient and I shall not in aught gainsay thee.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Musa: \"İnşaallah beni sabırlı bulacaksın ve senin hiçbir işine karşı gelmeyeceğim\" dedi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہا عنقریب اللہ چاہے تو تم مجھے صابر پاؤ گے اور میں تمہارے کسی حکم کے خلاف نہ کروں گا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Musa berkata: \"Insya Allah kamu akan mendapati aku sebagai orang yang sabar, dan aku tidak akan menentangmu dalam sesuatu urusanpun\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَتَجِدُنِىٓ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/1fe84860b7eab894e68f.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["ana"], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"text": "إِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَابِرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْصِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَمْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "4:121", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/614.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "For such, their habitation will be hell, and they will find no refuge therefrom.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bunların varacakları yer cehennemdir. Ondan kurtulmak için çare bulamazlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اُن کا ٹھکانا دوزخ ہے اس سے بچنے کی جگہ نہ پائیں گے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka itu tempatnya Jahannam dan mereka tidak memperoleh tempat lari dari padanya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَأْوَىٰهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَهَنَّمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَجِدُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/3e666789108f7385a009.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they find", "bs": "nalaze", "tr": "bulurlar", "fr": "ils trouvent", "id": "mereka mendapati", "ur": "وہ پاتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা খুঁজে পায়", "fa": "می‌یابند"}}, {"text": "عَنْهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَحِيصًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "21:53", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2536.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They said: We found our fathers worshippers of them.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar: \"Biz atalarımızı bunlara tapar bulduk\" dediler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولے ہم نے اپنے دادا کو ان کی پوجا کرتے پایا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka menjawab: \"Kami mendapati bapak-bapak kami menyembahnya\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَجَدْنَآ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/dc5a6ae0fb2a769f6570.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we found", "bs": "našli smo", "tr": "bulduk", "fr": "nous avons trouvé", "id": "kami telah mendapati", "ur": "ہم نے پایا", "bn": "আমরা পেয়েছি", "fa": "یافتیم"}}, {"text": "ءَابَآءَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَٰبِدِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "93:7", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6086.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Did He not find thee wandering and direct (thee)?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Seni yol bilmez bulup yola iletmedi mi?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تمہیں اپنی محبت میں خود رفتہ پایا تو اپنی طرف راہ دی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yang bingung, lalu Dia memberikan petunjuk.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَوَجَدَكَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0762d5d40f8ae01fabbf.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i našao te je", "en": "and He found you", "tr": "ve seni buldu", "fr": "et Il t'a trouvé", "id": "dan Dia mendapatimu", "ur": "اور اس نے تمہیں پایا", "bn": "এবং তিনি তোমাকে পেয়েছেন", "fa": "و تو را یافت"}}, {"text": "ضَآلًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَهَدَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "93:6", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6085.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Did He not find thee an orphan and protect (thee)?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O seni yetim bulup da barındırmadı mı?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کیا اس نے تمہیں یتیم نہ پایا پھر جگہ دی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Bukankah Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yatim, lalu Dia melindungimu?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَلَمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَجِدْكَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/b958f95b60bff9e4dfee.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "(zar te nije) našao", "en": "(did He not) find you", "tr": "(seni) bulmadı mı", "fr": "(ne t')a-t-Il pas) trouvé", "id": "(bukankah Dia) mendapatimu", "ur": "(کیا) اس نے تمہیں نہیں پایا", "bn": "(তিনি কি) তোমাকে পাননি", "fa": "(آیا) تو را نیافت"}}, {"text": "يَتِيمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَـَٔاوَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "12:94", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1690.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "When the caravan departed their father had said: Truly I am conscious of the breath of Joseph, though ye call me dotard.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ne zaman ki, kafile (Mısır'dan) ayrıldı, öteden babaları dedi ki: \"Eğer bana bunak demezseniz, doğrusu ben Yusuf'un kokusunu alıyorum.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جب قافلہ مصر سے جدا ہوا یہاں ان کے باپ نے کہا بیشک میں یوسف کی خوشبو پا تا ہوں اگر مجھے یہ نہ کہو کہ سٹھ (بہک) گیا ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Tatkala kafilah itu telah ke luar (dari negeri Mesir) berkata ayah mereka: \"Sesungguhnya aku mencium bau Yusuf, sekiranya kamu tidak menuduhku lemah akal (tentu kamu membenarkan aku)\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَمَّ